its text (OCR), or read its text aloud (Narrate).

  frame-snip            capture the window the Steam session has focused (the desktop, or a
                        window you floated) and open the selection window
  frame-snip FILE       select from an image file instead (for testing)
  frame-snip --narrate IMAGE TEXT   (internal) the narration panel: reads TEXT aloud beside IMAGE

